WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:08.588
Hi! I'm Lily, and I love cats! Cats can sleep and play anywhere. Let's look!

2
00:00:10.038 --> 00:00:12.545
This orange cat is in a box.

3
00:00:12.995 --> 00:00:15.642
Boxes are his favorite place!

4
00:00:17.892 --> 00:00:20.818
This little kitten is on the sofa.

5
00:00:21.268 --> 00:00:23.404
It can play there all day!

6
00:00:25.654 --> 00:00:28.534
This white cat is behind the window.

7
00:00:28.984 --> 00:00:30.888
It's waiting for its family.

8
00:00:33.138 --> 00:00:36.203
Look! The cat is next to the dog.

9
00:00:36.653 --> 00:00:38.557
They're very good friends.

10
00:00:40.807 --> 00:00:43.733
Look at these three cats at the window!

11
00:00:44.183 --> 00:00:48.223
The little white kitten is in front of the big cats.

12
00:00:50.473 --> 00:00:53.724
Oh, no! This cat is on my keyboard.

13
00:00:54.174 --> 00:00:55.753
I can't work today!

14
00:00:58.003 --> 00:01:02.600
And these kittens are in a basket. They're so cute!

15
00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:05.697
And you? Where is your pet now?

